# Measurement output of the throwaway stands. The protocol that matters is
# transcribed into docs/experiments/; the raw JSON is per-machine.
spikes/*/results/
# Third-party bundles copied in by `pnpm build` of a stand. They are a copy of
# what is already in node_modules and they are recreated on every build.
spikes/*/media/vendor/
# The native pty, copied in by `pnpm build:extension` (M3.4). Some 3 MB of
# prebuilt binaries that already exist in node_modules and are recreated by every
# build -- this line stands BEFORE the copy does, because a `git add -A` on a
# clean tree would otherwise commit them into the published repository.
packages/extension/assets/node-pty/
